ty copy of the original in color by \n citing the Call Number listed above and including the catalog record \n (&quot;About This Item&quot;) with your request.\n </p>\n</li>\n\n<li><strong>If there is no information listed in the Reproduction Number field \nabove:</strong> You can generally purchase a quality copy through \nDuplication Services. Cite the Call Number listed above and include the catalog record (&quot;About This Item&quot;) with \n your request.\n</li>\n</ol>\n</p>\n\n<p> \nPrice lists, contact information, and order forms are available on the\n <a href=\"//lcweb.loc.gov/preserv/pds/\">Duplication Services Web site</a>.  \n</p>\n\n\n\n", "resources": [{"caption": "digital file from original", "files": [[{"height": 0, "levels": 1, "mimetype": "image/tiff", "size": 20524606, "url": "https://tile.loc.gov/storage-services/master/pnp/det/4a20000/4a24000/4a24500/4a24552u.tif", "width": 0}, {"height": 0, "levels": 1, "mimetype": "image/tiff", "size": 163941109, "url": "https://tile.loc.gov/storage-services/master/pnp/det/4a20000/4a24000/4a24500/4a24552a.tif", "width": 0}, {"height": 120, "levels": 1, "mimetype": "image/jpeg", "size": 4654, "url": "https://tile.loc.gov/storage-services/service/pnp/det/4a20000/4a24000/4a24500/4a24552_150px.jpg", "width": 150}, {"height": 120, "levels": 1, "mimetype": "image/gif", "size": 11290, "url": "https://tile.loc.gov/storage-services/service/pnp/det/4a20000/4a24000/4a24500/4a24552t.gif", "width": 150}, {"height": 514, "levels": 1, "mimetype": "image/jpeg", "size": 61318, "url": "https://tile.loc.gov/storage-services/service/pnp/det/4a20000/4a24000/4a24500/4a24552r.jpg", "width": 640}, {"height": 822, "levels": 1, "mimetype": "image/jpeg", "size": 161771, "url": "https://tile.loc.gov/storage-services/service/pnp/det/4a20000/4a24000/4a24500/4a24552v.jpg", "width": 1024}]], "image": "https://tile.loc.gov/storage-services/service/pnp/det/4a20000/4a24000/4a24500/4a24552_150px.jpg", "url": "https://www.loc.gov/resource/det.4a2